  governed-rag uses haiku.rag-slim through its public API only: HaikuRAG
  client, AppConfig, import_document, search, and the Hook base class
  registered via the `haiku.rag.hooks` entry point. Pinned at 0.111.0.

- PyYAML (https://github.com/yaml/pyyaml), MIT License
- rich (https://github.com/Textualize/rich), MIT License

Optional, used only by `grag ingest --contract` and CI:

- corpusgate, MIT License, which depends on wimsey
  (https://github.com/benrutter/wimsey, MIT License, Ben Rutter).
- rag-eval-gate, MIT License, which depends on continuous-eval
  (https://github.com/relari-ai/continuous-eval, Apache License 2.0,
  Relari, Inc.). Installed in a separate environment in CI.

The sample corpus in examples/ is synthetic. Northwind Renewables and every
person, figure, phone number (555-01xx) and email address (example.com) in it
are fictional.
